<title>USA: Crown American Feb mall shop sales up.</title>
<headline>Crown American Feb mall shop sales up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHNSTOWN, Pa. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crown American Realty Trust said Thursday that mall shop sales for the month of February increased 5.3 percent over the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>For January and February combined, the company said mall shop sales are ahead 5.7 percent over the first two months of 1996.</p>
<p>For the two month period, Logan Valley Mall (Altoona, Pa.) led the portfolio with a 16.6 percent increase over 1996, the company said.</p>
</text>
